cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "sem2txm"
abstract: >-
  An unpaired SEM-to-TXM image translator for cracked 316L stainless steel, built to
  test whether hand-drawn SEM crack labels can be carried across modalities to train a
  TXM crack detector. A windowed-attention generator is trained with a contrastive
  content objective so that output structure stays registered to the input. Reads its
  data from the sem-crack-detector and TXM_Crack_Detection_Pipeline repositories rather
  than shipping its own copy.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Jiaming
    # affiliation and orcid intentionally left blank -- fill these in before citing.
repository-code: "https://github.com/jzhang29-max/sem2txm"
